        <p style="text-indent: 4em" rend="first-line-indent(4)" source="#source-29275-29346"><seg source="#source-29275-29305">帰りやすらん</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-29305-29341"><rb>天津日国</rb><rt>あまつひくに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-29341-29346">に</seg></p>
